Today we step inside the causeration home to unlock the everyday words that let you name the rooms and objects around you. I'm Olya, and this is Привет, Русский, Episode 75. Our word of the day is Akno. Okay, no. It means window. Imagine you window as the eye of the house. It lets light and views in just like an eye. Yes, I'm looking out the window. Repeat after me. Okay, no. Now that you know Akno,

