Ну, let's learn the word for door.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:32.500
Дверь.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:33.460
Дверь.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.120
Закрой дверь, пожалуйста.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.560
Клоз the door, please.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.460
It sounds a bit like door.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.020
Like a heavy wooden door you push to enter.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:42.360
